# Real /metrics content of a live SGLang v0.5.20 engine (tensor-parallel 2, a hybrid MoE model, speculative decoding on),
# captured 2026-10-04 through the Prometheus HTTP API (instant query of {__name__=~"sglang:.*"}), not by scraping the engine directly.
# Edits: Prometheus' own target labels (job, instance) and the exporter's pid label were dropped, the model_name value was replaced
# by "example-model", and only the series of the metrics the adapter reads (plus a few neighbours) were kept. Values are as stored.
# The engine was idle at capture time, so the gauges read 0; the counters and histograms hold its lifetime totals.
# `sglang:num_retracted_requests_total` is absent: the counter is only created at the first retraction.
